  "title": "What is Scenario Builder? - TransitionZero",
  "content": "What can Scenario Builder do ?\n- Analyze energy transition pathways for the power sector\n- Understand optimal capacity and generation mixes within a system\n- Assess the impact of demand, technology, economic, and policy constraints on emissions, price, and cost outcomes\nWhat type of research can Scenario Builder be used for?\nScenario Builder helps answer questions like:\n- What will it cost to decarbonise a country’s electricity grid?\n- What infrastructure investments are needed to meet rising demand?\n- What emissions reductions can we expect from current policies?",
